        "content": "<p>Hello ! I'm new here and trying to redo the Vector.ofFn method, I ran into a very simple problem which I can't manage to find the solution to...<br>\nSo I have a function expecting the return type <code>Vector a n</code> but I have <code>v : Vector a i</code> and <code>h : i = p</code>. <br>\nI am stuck trying to unifying those and would very much appreciate some help :)</p>",
